  "$description": "Component-scoped tokens: the colour/shape decisions owned by a specific component rather than by a page. A $ref here always points at a SEMANTIC role, never at a foundation value, except the gradient tokens whose `stops` are foundation colour ids (a gradient is not a single value, so it cannot be a theme-resolvable semantic role).",
